From 7916f28774a30db80e706a03065df7c5a4fca1a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Khaled <khaledchoucri@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 16:40:01 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 86/88] POC-21a: NaviCust replaces held items, chips replace
 TMs - held items do nothing in grid battles; items with a program become it
 (found, given, bought, caught; old saves on load); battle-only items held
 only at the Frontier; a TM is 3 chips; Move Relearner teaches chip moves; Gen
 6 Exp. Share toggle; Everstone, SoothBel, SmokeBal programs

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FbWSqvcg6G5Gpw6ynvR5tJ
